senses.sense_text:
A location first mentioned at Num.34.6; 
referred to as Great_Sea or Great (Sea) (=Qere. Ketiv= "border," KJV= "the great sea," NIV= Mediterranean Sea) (גָּדוֹל), or (Sea of the )Philistines (NIV= Mediterranean Sea) (פְּלִשְׁתִּי). §adj
great

A location in Jerusalem first mentioned at Neh.3.1; 
only referred to as Tower_of_the_Hundred (מִגְדָּל מֵאָה). §
This name means tower
